# ── Large model rasters (~284 MB) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Deliberately out of git (three files are ~70 MB each). They are published as
# the assets of the GitHub release factors-v1; fetch_factors.py downloads them
# and verifies them against models/factors_manifest.json, which IS tracked.
# Needed for the rainfall scenario and the point-query terrain values — see
# flood_model_bundle/README.md §1.
flood_model_bundle/models/factors/

